@startuml state-catalog-store
!include include/style.iuml
title Catalog store lifecycle
hide empty description

[*] --> Configured : LocaleConfig validated
Configured --> Loading : Localization created
Loading --> Ready : all catalogs parsed,\nfallback chains built
Loading --> Failed : missing directory or\nunreadable catalog
Failed --> [*] : CatalogLoadError,\napplication does not start
state Ready : read only, shared by all requests
Ready --> Reloading : files changed\n(development only, planned)
Reloading --> Ready : new store swapped in atomically
Reloading --> Ready : reload failed,\nprevious store kept
Ready --> [*] : process exits
@enduml
